6f5dacd6","priority":0.8,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","scenarios":["Implementer registers set/remove in _mcp_reads.py under READ_ONLY annotation, mis-declaring write side-effects to MCP clients","The _mcp_writes.py edit needed for set/remove is missed because Scope never lists it"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Split the MCP surface in Approach/Scope: `list` -> _mcp_reads.py (read-only), `set`/`remove` -> _mcp_writes.py (register_write_tools), mirroring the existing reads/writes MCP division.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"omits_required_site","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Clarify the MCP surface split: name _mcp_writes.py (register_write_tools) for the projects set/remove writes and reserve _mcp_reads.py for the list read, or explicitly narrow the AC to say MCP exposes only the read path.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"block","drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'the bridge MCP surface is src/rebar/_mcp_reads.py'","src/rebar/_mcp_reads.py:1-3 'Read-tool registrar... registers the always-available read tools' via register_read_tools","src/